  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-005 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, and Sivir. Version 0.7.4 drives ban/pick splashes from the card's live ImageRunner source as well as MatchUIRunner data, matching the reliable runtime route used by working ban/pick presentation mods. It also restores readable Red Brambleback, Blue Sentinel, and Murk Wolf scale while retaining centered bodies, native landing lines, and stable animation timing. The pack includes full-body encyclopedia portraits, image-generated objectives, neutral monsters, towers, Nexus crystals, League-style item art, and locally extracted official Baron audio for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
